, "author": {"steamid": "76561198162865832", "personaname": "Anh Alexander", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AnhAlexander/", "num_games_owned": 268, "num_reviews": 227, "playtime_forever": 5733, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5731, "last_played": 1682796567, "avatar": "e613d2b175501a28041b65c22e0e454b3681c9f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fabulous final installment of the Mass Effect trilogy.  Having played both of the previous games, I will say that you need to play them all in order to get the full experience of the characters and the universe.  Although it has been criticized for its ending, I actually found it touching, dramatic, and a fitting end to the series (I think that perhaps the previous installment's absolute masterpiece of an ending sequence set the bar too high for this game).  My one complaint is that the EA Origin integration is just such a cumbersome bother.", "timestamp_created": 1604050356, "timestamp_updated": 1604050356, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.64043503999710083", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 2, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "78356265", "author": {"steamid": "76561198403613148", "personaname": "gradcristi", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gradcristi/", "num_games_owned": 237, "num_reviews": 91, "playtime_forever": 153, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 153, "last_played": 1603737608, "avatar": "1f472ce8e278212d9fae2bae6ae623953f983738"}, "language": "english", "review": "Doesnt work well with the Origin integration. After 2 back2back mass effect games, it just felt like more of a same i had enough of. Not enough new ideas. I suppose it is normal for the 3rd game in 6 years.", "timestamp_created": 1603999445, "timestamp_updated": 1603999445, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492331087589263916", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "78301021", "author": {"steamid": "76561199085354143", "personaname": "Kojio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199085354143/", "num_games_owned": 148, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2649, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2449, "last_played": 1611035014, "avatar": "b539d6d57bdab3025ee3d1ea35013c73b0812c03"}, "language": "english", "review": "Hell I recommend this. it's still better than MEA. Not as good as the second but they have improve on a lot of the mechanics.  I assume you are here because you played the first two or maybe just the second one.  Another thing about this you have to go to origins to download any DLC to complete this game like the last one. So expect to pay some extra from orgins.  game is a 9/10 because of the ending", "timestamp_created": 1603910546, "timestamp_updated": 1603910546, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.551656901836395264", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}]}